Package: pannamodels
Title: Pre-Trained Models for Football Analytics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Pete", "Owen", email = "peteowen1@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides pre-trained machine learning models for football analytics,
    served via GitHub releases with local caching. Models include xG (expected goals),
    xPass, EPV (expected possession value), and match prediction models. Used by the
    panna package for player ratings and match prediction.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
